,0,0,0.0],"cost_cuts":[0,0,0,0.0],"guidance":[0,0,0,0.0,{"raise":0,"reaffirm":0,"cut":0}]},"move":{"r1":0.1074,"r5":0.0889,"r1_spy":0.1043,"r5_spy":0.056}}],"quotes":[{"c":"COMP 2021 Q2","e":"comp","d":"2021-08-09","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Robert Reffkin","x":"And we've seen it play out across many industries, including media streaming, food delivery, and of course, real estate.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/08/09/compass-inc-comp-q2-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"COMP 2021 Q2","e":"comp","d":"2021-08-09","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Robert Reffkin","x":"We are well positioned in the upper end of the market where price increases have outpaced the broader market, and we will continue to expand our footprint into upper- and mid-tier markets throughout the course of the year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/08/09/compass-inc-comp-q2-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"COMP 2021 Q2","e":"comp","d":"2021-08-09","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Kristen Ankerbrandt","x":"We touched on commissions and other, but we saw it down the entire P&L. About 680 basis points came from sales and marketing, and that was really related to economies of scale given some offset by costs associated with a greater number of average principal agents and some price increases.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/08/09/compass-inc-comp-q2-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"COMP 2021 Q2","e":"comp","d":"2021-08-09","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Kristen Ankerbrandt","x":"We dramatically raised guidance for the full-year 2021, and we now expect to achieve sustainable adjusted EBITDA profitability in 2022.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/08/09/compass-inc-comp-q2-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"COMP 2021 Q3","e":"comp","d":"2021-11-10","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Robert Reffkin","x":"I'll be back at the end to answer Q&A, but now let me pass it on to Kristen to take the floor.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/11/compass-inc-comp-q3-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"COMP 2021 Q3","e":"comp","d":"2021-11-10","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Kristen Ankerbrandt","x":"On our last earnings call, we increased our annual guidance to $6.15 billion to $6.35 billion in revenue.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/11/compass-inc-comp-q3-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"COMP 2021 Q4","e":"comp","d":"2022-02-16","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Robert Reffkin","x":"A primary example of how we connect our coaching investments with business outcomes for agents is the likely to sell AI tool, which is particularly important in this low inventory environment.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/02/17/compass-inc-comp-q4-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"COMP 2021 Q4","e":"comp","d":"2022-02-16","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Kristen Ankerbrandt","x":"For one to conclude that the market will decline, that would mean a significant decline in transactions to offset the aforementioned price increases, a scenario that we view to be highly unlikely.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/02/17/compass-inc-comp-q4-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"COMP 2022 Q1","e":"comp","d":"2022-05-12","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Robert Reffkin","x":"There are -- the estimates that we generally look at are price increases of between 10% to 13%.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/05/13/compass-inc-comp-q1-2022-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"COMP 2022 Q1","e":"comp","d":"2022-05-12","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Robert Reffkin","x":"And the price increases this year are consistent with what they look like in the first few months of last year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/05/13/compass-inc-comp-q1-2022-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"COMP 2022 Q1","e":"comp","d":"2022-05-12","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Kristen Ankerbrandt","x":"We welcome the opportunity to accelerate some of the cost savings initiatives that were already planned for 2023, as we march toward our 2025 targets.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/05/13/compass-inc-comp-q1-2022-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"COMP 2022 Q2","e":"comp","d":"2022-08-15","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Kristen Ankerbrandt","x":"When we look at the market, we have seen prices -- the price increases start to slow down, which think will ultimately be really positive for the market overall.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/08/15/compass-inc-comp-q2-2022-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"COMP 2022 Q2","e":"comp","d":"2022-08-15","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Kristen Ankerbrandt","x":"In June, as market conditions continue to weaken, we initiated a cost reduction plan to better align our operating expenses with our lower revenue expectations.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/08/15/compass-inc-comp-q2-2022-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"COMP 2022 Q2","e":"comp","d":"2022-08-15","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Kristen Ankerbrandt","x":"This started with a 10% reduction in our employee workforce as well other cost reduction measures.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/08/15/compass-inc-comp-q2-2022-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"COMP 2022 Q2","e":"comp","d":"2022-08-15","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Kristen Ankerbrandt","x":"Given the market uncertainty, we are lowering our outlook for the full year 2022 to $6.15 billion to $6.45 billion, which represents revenue growth of negative 4% to positive 0.5% for the full year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/08/15/compass-inc-comp-q2-2022-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"COMP 2022 Q3","e":"comp","d":"2022-11-10","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Robert Reffkin","x":"It's not a one-size-fits-all, but I think a general growth on the markets that had the fastest price increases are seeing the most pain at this time.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/11/10/compass-inc-comp-q3-2022-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"COMP 2022 Q3","e":"comp","d":"2022-11-10","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Robert Reffkin","x":"We believe that the actions we have taken to date and cost reduction initiatives currently in place put us on pace to deliver our targeted non-GAAP operating expense run rate of between 1.05 and $1.15 billion exiting 2022.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/11/10/compass-inc-comp-q3-2022-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"COMP 2022 Q3","e":"comp","d":"2022-11-10","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Robert Reffkin","x":"And as a result, we will be implementing additional cost reduction initiatives to get ahead of any future market declines.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/11/10/compass-inc-comp-q3-2022-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"COMP 2022 Q4","e":"comp","d":"2023-02-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Robert Reffkin","x":"As the market deteriorate fast, we moved quickly to respond and initiated cost-cutting actions that reduced our non-GAAP operating expenses by $338 million, which is 23% less on an annualized basis from the second quarter of 2022 to the fourth quarter of 2022.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/02/28/compass-comp-q4-2022-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"COMP 2022 Q4","e":"comp","d":"2023-02-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Greg Hart","x":"When the revenue growth that we and the rest of the industry expected for 2022 did not materialize, we had to make the difficult decision to reduce headcount, taking actions in June, September, and at the beginning of January of this year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/02/28/compass-comp-q4-2022-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"COMP 2023 Q1","e":"comp","d":"2023-05-09","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Greg Hart","x":"As the leading tech-enabled brokerage, we started investing in AI technology in implementing in our platform years ago.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/05/09/compass-comp-q1-2023-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"COMP 2023 Q1","e":"comp","d":"2023-05-09","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Greg Hart","x":"We also believe that we'll see an outsized return on our AI investments because of our integrated platform that AI tools can build upon and enhance.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/05/09/compass-comp-q1-2023-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"COMP 2023 Q1","e":"comp","d":"2023-05-09","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Robert Reffkin","x":"I'll start and then I'll pass it on to Kalani.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/05/09/compass-comp-q1-2023-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"COMP 2023 Q1","e":"comp","d":"2023-05-09","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Robert Reffkin","x":"But in terms of your second question around attach rates, I'll pass it on to Kalani.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/05/09/compass-comp-q1-2023-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"COMP 2023 Q1","e":"comp","d":"2023-05-09","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Kalani Reelitz","x":"However, due to our cost reduction initiatives implemented over the past year, the $243 million of opex for the first quarter reflects a $120 million reduction from an opex of $363 million in the same period a year ago.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/05/09/compass-comp-q1-2023-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"COMP 2023 Q1","e":"comp","d":"2023-05-09","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Kalani Reelitz","x":"Additionally, during the first quarter, we incurred a restructuring charge of $10